      "raw_text": "Here is the step-by-step solution to the problem:\n\n**Step 1: Calculate the amount of money Ava gave Jayden.**\nAva gave Jayden half of her $90 allowance.\n$$90 / 2 = 45$$\nSo, Ava gave Jayden $45.\n\n**Step 2: Calculate the total amount of money Jayden currently has.**\nJayden started with $70 and received $45 from his sister.\n$$70 + 45 = 115$$\nJayden now has $115.\n\n**Step 3: Calculate how much more money is needed to buy the camera.**\nThe camera costs $200, and Jayden has $115. We subtract the amount he has from the total cost.\n$$200 - 115 = 85$$\n\nJayden needs $85 more to buy the camera.\n\n#### 85<|im_end|>",
